  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> (Fast)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> (Slow)<br />As we know that slow step is<br />Rate determine step<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>[</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></math> (i)<br />From last step<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>[</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></math> (ii)<br />From equation (i)&amp;(ii)<br />Rate <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></msqrt><msup><